	(text "ADC: SIN on ADC0, COS on ADC1 of the same track -> sampled simultaneously.\nSIN1 A0_12/PA14, COS1 A1_0/PA15, SIN2 A0_1/PA26, COS2 A1_1/PA16.\nVREF+ = REF35330 (3.3 V), VREF- = GND. ROSC 100k 0.1 % for SYSOSC FCL.\nLAYOUT: decoupling caps at VDD/VSS and VCORE pins, VREF caps at PA23.\nLAYOUT: ROSC resistor right at PA2, short ground return."
